        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roughhouzzers</strong> is a highly linear side-scrolling action RPG with a focus on frantic, fast paced active-time combat. Turns are dictated purely by a cooldown bar and combat never stops or pauses. Follow three wildly different fellas through the day as their adventures eventually converge. Go to college. Buy guns. Solve a dispute between two street gangs. Complete your task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175260/extras/7c2b06381402bd3ebf555d6a5cae6fa2.poster.avif?t=1764531632\" width=660 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175260/extras/7c2b06381402bd3ebf555d6a5cae6fa2.webm?t=1764531632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~3 hours of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Droll storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hectic active-time RPG battle system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of other things related to the number 3.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
